{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Every word.</b> A light matter as a strict matter (ibid.)." "<b>You shall observe to do.</b> To set לֹא תַעֲשֶׂה upon the עֲשֵׂה stated in the passage — for every הִשָּׁמֶר is the language of לֹא תַעֲשֶׂה, except that one does not receive lashes for a הִשָּׁמֶר of עֲשֵׂה (Makkot 13)." "<b>You shall not add to it.</b> Five טֹטָפוֹת, four species in the lulav, four blessings for the priestly blessing (Sifrei)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:53.713871254Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}